  },
  {
   "id": "273e4b860abb",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**EU AI Act Risk Tiers**\n\n🔴 Unacceptable: BANNED\n🟠 High: conformity assessment\n🟡 Limited: transparency\n🟢 Minimal: no regulation",
   "x": -1700,
